cks Consensus Estimate (someone else's forecast section; source as stored Zacks / Zacks Investment Research (Zacks Consensus Estimate) / Zacks Consensus (Zacks Investment Research)) | T-123:92,T-129:11,T-133:231\nSales growth 88% (a growth rate, not a level) | this fiscal year (FY2027) | Zacks Investment Research (someone else's forecast section; basis: Zacks-stated expectation for NVIDIA) | T-143:136\nSales growth 88% (consensus expectation) | this year | Consensus analysts (someone else's forecast section; source as stored: Consensus analysts; said 2026-09-29) | T-144:218\nRevenue growth 91% (company-wide) | This year (fiscal 2027, as framed by the article) | Wall Street consensus (analysts) (someone else's forecast section) | T-145:50\nRevenue growth roughly 90% or more | current fiscal year | Forecaster not named; source not stored (someone else's forecast section; basis: expectations reported by qz.com) | T-130:16\nConsensus revenue forecast $111.3 billion (above the top of the company's $108 billion plus or minus 2% guidance range) | fiscal Q3 2027 | Consensus of analysts (unnamed) (someone else's forecast section) | T-124:232\nConsensus sales estimate $109.02 billion (up 91.2% / 91.24% on the year-ago quarter) | 'Current quarter' (T-131, said 2026-09-22); 'upcoming quarter' (T-146) | Zacks Consensus Estimate (someone else's forecast section; source as stored Zacks Investment Research (Zacks Consensus Estimate) / Zacks Consensus (Zacks Investment Research)) | T-131:11,T-146:231\nConsensus revenue estimate $109.0 billion, up 91.2% from the previous year | 'Next quarter (Q3 fiscal 2027, report expected late November 2026)' (T-136); 'Next quarter (Q3 fiscal 2027)' (T-135) | Analyst consensus (as reported by fool.com) (someone else's forecast section) | T-136:73,T-135:73\nQ3 revenue growth +91.2% year over year (consensus expected change) | Q3 2026 | Zacks (consensus analyst estimate) (someone else's forecast section) | T-140:171\nRevenue growth more than 80% (com